# Data & security

Schema: @context/data-model.md

- RLS on every table from day one. Service role server-side only; middleware on private routes.
- Never expose service role or `GOOGLE_GENERATIVE_AI_API_KEY` to the client.
- Public `(public)/` routes must not query or render private practice data.
- `songs.is_shared` is reserved for future public home sync (Phase 4 — not built).
